vice deployment is not in a ready state (0/1), I need to examine detailed deployment events and container status. This will reveal potential issues like image pull failures, startup errors, resource constraints, or configuration problems preventing the pod from starting successfully.', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=352, prompt_tokens=2434, total_tokens=2786, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfcc0-34c4-7181-8364-6afd0cfeed6e-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2434, 'output_tokens': 352, 'total_tokens': 2786}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='e2cd2c05-413b-48ba-90a1-d93940a499ee')]]
